ames_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on December 28, 2022 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p>From the sidelines to the spotlight, the <a href=\"/wiki/White_Mask\" title=\"White Mask\">White Mask</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a> features in this new special issue that ties together threads from both <a href=\"/wiki/Slaughterverse\" title=\"Slaughterverse\">Slaughterverse</a> series... but will her loyalties remain where they have always been, or will she show her true colors?<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Paris (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUGFyaXM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Paris</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Tybalt (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHliYWx0P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Tybalt</span></li>\n<li>Benny</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"363a1a2c198c9b830e24568221ab94cb\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wi